      contactKey: maya
      contactName: Maya
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      text: Hey, stranger. Any chance we can convince you to leave your apartment this weekend?
      isSystem: 0
      replies:
      - text: Depends. What are you trying to convince me to do?
        response: Lunch tomorrow. Marcus found this place right on the Bay. Apparently the view is good enough that Alex has already threatened to take forty pictures of it.
        connectednessDelta: 10
        suspicionDelta: 0
      - text: Maybe. It's been kind of a long week.
        response: That's exactly why you should come. Food, fresh air, people who aren't coworkers. Very advanced recovery techniques.
        connectednessDelta: 10
        suspicionDelta: 0
      - text: I don't know. I'm probably just going to stay home.
        response: You can decide tomorrow. I'm not letting you escape that easily.
        connectednessDelta: 0
        suspicionDelta: 0
      waitForReply: 0
